  "title": "Bloomberg Law reports that Burford is expected to join Russell 3000® and 2000® indexes",
  "summary": "Bloomberg Law's \"Wakeup Call\" includes news that Burford Capital is expected to join the broad-market Russell 3000 and small-cap Russell 2000 Indexes after the US market opens on July 1, 2024, marking \"'the first entry of legal finance—an emerging asset class—to the Indexes.'\"",
